---
import OfficialLayout from '../layouts/OfficialLayout.astro'
---

<OfficialLayout title="关于我们" description="珠江国际商事调解院 - 粤港澳大湾区领先的商事调解机构">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image: url('/images/hero-bg.jpg');" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/85 via-blue-900/75 to-gray-900/85" />
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 text-xs text-white/80 mb-4">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        <span>机构介绍</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white">关于我们</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-blue-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto">About Us</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Content -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Institution Overview -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">机构概况</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-base">
          <p>
            珠江国际商事调解院是经广东省司法厅批准设立的专业商事调解机构，
            立足于粤港澳大湾区核心城市广州，面向全球提供一站式商事争议解决服务。
          </p>
          <p>
            本院由深耕仲裁与调解领域数十年的资深法律专业人士共同发起，
            汇聚了来自<strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">中国大陆、香港、澳门及国际</strong>的法律、金融、
            知识产权、国际贸易等各领域的顶尖专家与调解员。
          </p>
          <p>
            作为粤港澳大湾区商事争议解决体系的重要组成部分，珠江国际商事调解院以
            <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">发挥调解优势、促进湾区合作、优化营商环境</strong>为宗旨，
            致力于为中外当事人提供高效、专业、保密的调解服务。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mission -->
      <div class="mb-16 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50 rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">机构使命</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          努力为每一起纠纷提供最佳解决方案
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600/70 dark:text-blue-400/70 mt-2 italic">
          The Best Solution For Each Dispute
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Values - Vision -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">发展愿景</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">国际一流</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">对标国际先进调解机构，打造具有国际影响力的商事调解品牌</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="10" x="3" y="11" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"/><path d="M12 7v4"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="16" y2="16"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="16" y2="16"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">科技驱动</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">深度融合人工智能与法律科技，构建智能化在线调解平台</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">人才为本</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">汇聚境内外顶级调解专家，培养高素质商事调解专业人才</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Values -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">核心价值观</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">中立公正</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">坚持调解员中立立场，平等对待各方当事人，确保调解程序与结果的公正性。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">专业保密</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">严格遵守保密原则，保护商业秘密与当事人隐私。每位调解员均具备专业资质与丰富实务经验。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">高效便捷</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">简化调解流程，运用线上平台打破时空限制，大幅缩短纠纷解决周期，降低当事人成本。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">创新卓越</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">积极探索 AI 辅助调解等创新模式，不断提升服务质量与效率，追求卓越的争议解决体验。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Team / Expert Panel -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">专家团队</h2>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            本院调解员及专家团队均经过严格遴选与专业培训，具备以下资质：
          </p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">至少十年法律、金融、贸易或相关领域实务经验</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">接受过系统的国际商事调解专业培训</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">持有律师、仲裁员或其他相关专业执业资格</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">具备良好的双语或多语沟通能力</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Partnerships -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">合作与发展</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">国内外合作</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              珠江国际商事调解院积极与境内外仲裁机构、法院、律所、商会等建立战略合作关系，
              构建覆盖大湾区和"一带一路"沿线国家的多元化争议解决服务网络。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">学术交流</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              定期举办商事调解国际研讨会、专题论坛和专业培训活动，推动调解理论与实务的学术交流与经验分享，
              促进粤港澳大湾区调解标准的统一与发展。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-16 text-center">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          联系我们了解更多
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</OfficialLayout>
